Id: path010w
Severity: WARN
Category: accounts
Check: check_path
Fix: Bring the file server back or unmount the share, then run again.
References: mount(8); nfs(5)
Controls: CIS 4.1; NIST CM-6; ISO 8.9; CE Secure configuration

The user's home directory is on a filesystem that did not answer
within Tiger_Mount_Timeout seconds (a hard NFS or CIFS mount whose
server is down). The shell initialisation files there were not read,
so this user's PATH was not checked. Bring the server back, or unmount
the share, and run again.
